{"id":"n4a4029d63e","headline":"India’s Fuel Exports Fall 31% In May, Drop To Lowest Level Since October 2022","summary":"India's fuel exports fell 31% in May to 878,000 barrels per day, the lowest since October 2022. Higher LPG production, refinery maintenance, export taxes and efforts to secure domestic supply during the Middle East conflict contributed.","why":"India is a major refined fuel exporter, so changes in its export volumes affect global product markets and regional oil flows.","category":"commodities","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.614,"lon":77.209,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/indias-fuel-exports-fall-31-in-may-drop-to-lowest-level-since-october-2022"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/indias-fuel-exports-fall-31-in-may-drop-to-lowest-level-since-october-2022"}],"published_at":"2026-06-02T11:41:24Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:20:22Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"43002a8563994f57","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:20:22Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-02T11:41:24Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-02T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"CH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-2251247.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"michaelmep","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/refinery-oil-refinery-oil-industry-2251247/"}}